SUMMARY:Lake and Crepe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nA morning lakeside stroll ending with cr
 epes.\n\nThere is some parking on Memory Lane or plenty up the street in f
 ront of the rose walk on Lakeshore Drive.\n\nThe lake walk is about a two 
 mile loop (taking the bridge that cuts off the section along the main road
 ).\n\nCrepe & Custard has both sweet and savory options.\nCheck the menu h
 ere:\n[https://www.crepeandcustard.com/menu/](https://www.crepeandcustard.
 com/menu/)\n\nFeel free to bring well behaved dogs!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314228435
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T114052Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T114052Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314353377@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260429T035049Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T160000
SUMMARY:The RAD Walk: Movement\, Kindness\, and Fresh Air
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n\\*UPDATE (Construction blockage) - We w
 ill be starting at **229 Riverside Dr.** and walking a path down Lyman str
 eet that takes us past Hi-Wire toward Amboy Road\, and then turning back a
 round.\n\n* **Total Distance:** Approximately 3-4 miles (but your distance
  is your choice).\n* **Time:** About 1.5 hours.\n* **Flexibility:** Rememb
 er\, this is your walk. If 3-4 miles feels like too much\, you can turn ar
 ound at any point (like when we reach Hi-Wire) to head back to the start.\
 n\nWe will meet at the location in the event picture.\nDon't forget the su
 ntan lotion if it's a sunny day :)\nWe will wait 10 minutes after the even
 t time\, and then we start the walk.\n\n\\*Please keep an eye on this meet
 up event for any updates if weather isn't ideal. If there is rain\, we wil
 l probably reschedule.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314353377
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260418T192515Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260418T192515Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
